{
  "id": "tornado",
  "name": "Tornado Cash",
  "description": "Tornado Cash is a non-custodial privacy protocol on Ethereum: users deposit fixed amounts of ETH or tokens into immutable pool contracts and later withdraw to a different address with a zero-knowledge proof, breaking the on-chain link. The US sanctions imposed in 2022 were lifted in March 2025; the interface is published on IPFS under tornadocash.eth.",
  "description_zh": "Tornado Cash 是以太坊上的非托管隐私协议：用户将固定金额的 ETH 或代币存入不可变的资金池合约，之后通过零知识证明提取到另一个地址，从而切断链上关联。2022 年实施的美国制裁已于 2025 年 3 月解除；其界面通过 tornadocash.eth 发布在 IPFS 上。",
